  ('PHY 118', 'General Physics for Physical Sciences III', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Pure and Industrial Chemistry', '100 Level', 'second', 2, 'Electrostatics; Coulomb''s law, electric field, Gauss''s law, electrostatic potential, fields due to simple charge distributions. Energy in electric fields, capacitance. Dielectrics, polarization. Electric current, Ohm''s law. Elements of circuit theory. Thermoelectric effect. Magnetic effects of current. Ampere''s law, fields due to simple circuits. Permanent magnetism, Earth''s magnetic field; ferromagnetism, moving coil instruments. Faraday''s law of induction; generators, electric motors. Alternating current. Maxwell''s equations. Elements of atomic and nuclear physics.', '["Electrostatics", "Coulomb''s law, electric field, Gauss''s law, electrostatic potential, fields due to simple charge distributions", "Energy in electric fields, capacitance", "Dielectrics, polarization", "Electric current, Ohm''s law", "Elements of circuit theory", "Thermoelectric effect", "Magnetic effects of current", "Ampere''s law, fields due to simple circuits", "Permanent magnetism, Earth''s magnetic field", "Ferromagnetism, moving coil instruments", "Faraday''s law of induction", "Generators, electric motors", "Alternating current", "Maxwell''s equations", "Elements of atomic and nuclear physics"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Pure and Industrial Chemistry undergraduate programme'),
