  ('PHY 251', 'Electromagnetism', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Pure and Industrial Chemistry', '200 Level', 'first', 2, 'Electrostatics. Gauss'' Law. Fields of charge distribution, methods of images. Dielectrics, Polarization. Electric current, current density. D.C. network theory. Ampere''s Law, magnetic fields of simple circuits. Faraday''s law of induction, self and mutual inductances, inductively coupled circuits. Transients in capacitive and inductive circuits. A.C. circuit analysis. Magnetization and hysteresis. Permanent magnetism - Diamagnetism, Paramagnetism and ferromagnetism. Lorentz force. Hall Effect. Maxwell''s equation - electromagnetic waves.

